OL,3,GNEWSAPeople who throw litter from cars 
OL,4,Ato face fines                          
OL,6,FPeople who drop litter from vehicles   
OL,7,Fcould face fines of up to #200 as a    
OL,8,Fcouncil asks people to submit dashcam  
OL,9,Ffootage.                               
OL,11,FCotswold District Council said it was  
OL,12,Fcracking down on the issue as it       
OL,13,Fspoiled the area's natural beauty,     
OL,14,Fcosted taxpayers' money to clear up and
OL,15,Fcould harm wildlife.                   
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
