OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAPeople who throw litter from cars 
OL,4,Ato face fines                          
OL,6,F"It also puts people at risk," said    
OL,7,Fcouncillor Andrea Pellegram. "Our waste
OL,8,Fcrews and volunteer litter pickers     
OL,9,Foften have to work close to moving     
OL,10,Ftraffic, while discarded cigarette ends
OL,11,Fcan increase the risk of fires during  
OL,12,Fhot weather," she added.               
OL,14,FPeople will be able to submit footage  
OL,15,Fof littering and fly tipping via the   
OL,16,Fcouncil's website from early next year.
